  fullText: "Entry 6                                                                                                                                                                                 
    \n\nThere is no doubt about it. Scans of the Visitor's interior have shown a\ncomplex
    electronic system that could not have been achieved by us.                                                                                                                                                                                 
    \nWe are trying to decrypt the data it holds, but our excitement has\nslowed
    down progress. We believe this might hold information related\nto a species from
    another planet and likely has a message for us.                                                                                                                                                                                 
    \n\nThere is still a lot of work to do before we can share our discoveries.                                                                                                                                                                                  "
